@startuml Donation and Box Intake

title A donation arrives, is packed into a box, and is attested
caption Target design. Decisions O22, D14, D9, D5, D6, O16, D1, D21, D7, D3, D2, O17, O29, D35. ADRs 0011, 0013, 0014.

autonumber

actor Donor as donor
actor Dispatcher as disp
actor Loader as loader
participant "Freedom API" as api
database "Freedom database" as db
participant "Offline translator\n(in-process)" as mt

== Optional: the donor announces it ==
donor -> disp : email: "a box is coming"
disp -> api : record donor and donation
api -> db : Donor + DonorDetail (erasable), Donation
disp -> api : create box (Expected), destination Receiver
api -> db : check Receiver is **registered**
alt Receiver not registered (D35)
  api --> disp : 409, cannot be a destination
else registered
  api -> db : Box (Expected)
end
note right of disp
  Entering the box early is optional.
  It can be created when it arrives.
end note

== The box arrives at a hub ==
loader -> api : check in at location, place in bay
note right of loader
  A Loader sees only the locations they manage (O14).
end note
api -> db : Box location and bay (Arrived)

== The Loader records the items ==
loop for each item
  loader -> api : add item: category, quantity, value (GBP) + source,\nexpiry, donation
  api -> db : category -> customs codes (UK, EU, UA) from the mapping
  alt category is not carried (gas, lithium batteries, flammables)
    api --> loader : warning: not carried, take appropriate measures (D21)
  else expired
    api --> loader : warning: expired, the box cannot be attested (D1)
  else short shelf life
    api --> loader : warning: short remaining shelf life (D25)
  else sensitive category
    api --> loader : flagged sensitive; the Dispatcher will be warned (D7)
  end
end

== The Loader attests the box ==
loader -> api : validate box (weight, dimensions)
note right : The signer is taken from the login, never the request body
alt an item has expired
  api --> loader : 409, remove or replace the item first
else
  api -> db : ValidatedBy, ValidatedAt (write-once)\ncontents now fixed
  api --> loader : attested
end

== The label is printed ==
loader -> api : issue QR code and print label
api -> mt : translate item lines to Ukrainian
mt --> api : Ukrainian text (no network used)
api --> loader : label: box number, item list and signer,\nin English and Ukrainian
note right of loader
  Never a Receiver, region or address on the label.
  The Ukrainian text is not marked as a translation (O29).
end note

@enduml
